  caseIndex: 6
  caseSender: V Bank Corp.
  caseSubject: Is this even human?
  caseBody: 'The Case:

    The security guard shown here was confirmed to be on
    sick leave, yet he is seen waving into the camera. We suspect this is just the
    guard playing a prank on the company, but the behavior is extremely strange and
    unprofessional, making us question if there is a more sinister explanation beneath
    the surface. We need proof this is only a human hoax.'
